passed symbolic term is typed at the kind of the source skolem
passed Prelude.id returns the symbolic operand at the skolem's kind
passed a distinct neutral keeps its identity at the same spelling and kind
passed imported Prelude.id with a rigid argument
passed nested closure under same-spelling binders
passed projection does not demand its divergent operand
passed divergent operand itself runs out of fuel
passed neutral application retains a suspended operand
passed rigid case preserves its strict scrutinee and alternatives
passed unsolved case records a resumable unknown
passed supplying the missing definition allows the case to reduce
passed boxed pair projection skips its divergent field
passed a rigid pair retains its constructor case
passed an unsolved pair retains the same constructor case
passed supplying the pair replays selection without demanding the unused field
